# Rust Harvester's ability is activated at Bot2 (the Bauble is exiled as the cost), and Bot2 answers with Swift Reconfiguration on
# the Harvester: it is a Vehicle artifact and no longer a creature (CR 205.1a). The ability resolves: the +1/+1 counter goes on the
# Harvester, still the same permanent, and "it deals damage equal to its power" uses its current information (CR 608.2h) - a
# noncreature permanent has no power (CR 208.3), so it deals no damage (CR 120.8) and Bot2 stays at 20. The counter was put on a
# noncreature permanent, where it did nothing; once Disenchant destroys the Aura the Harvester is a creature again and the counter
# applies (CR 208.3a, 613.4c): a 2/2.

